# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# The Lennard-Jones table tunable by pairs of types (D[python-tunable-pairs],
# #160): an update during a run that breaks the combining rule equals, to the
# bit, a compile with the new values.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide pairs GPU Double | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide pairs GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU {{Double|Mixed}}: pairs: an update at step 6 off the combining rule and 10 steps equal a compile with the new values from that state to the bit
# CHECK: pairs passed
